: "639967009014526", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391845_639967012347859_8696163035317677617_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0uPhiV1AVEwQ7kNvwH17xpd&_nc_oc=AdqifXRiNegX_zTojORB7KlrSQHaTQ8aJTQT1xHsE_XQebymYs3ebwtgVg8gguFC7oU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMXbmliYH8pZsTfyg3GYHtEtm6KF3bMcLr7kaUqahgsvQ&oe=6ABFDE12"}, {"file_name": "IMG_20250407_175123.png", "id": "1180194287180680", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391814_1180194290514013_2503762577210822052_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k51x7LLAlokQ7kNvwFGVw8V&_nc_oc=Ado-xS9MI18FxF4VzDGQAiuXxax71suy4GJL5G-29QoQn7eKgM3g8UospdQ9gX8pPXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMwWN6EFTyglXHTuf8UT5o1Nn38XuDZ3VJ-44ub1ewqNg&oe=6ABFDB7B"}, {"file_name": "IMG_20250407_175210.png", "id": "1710344276545084", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391739_1710344279878417_6392433131893774073_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xPENphmXmDEQ7kNvwEWuivJ&_nc_oc=AdrknmJIYwwYRNzyVkhnc8Jx4uqvIYAsXj9GY9khCHhSJo9OLXCgF3_JQjeXIERAhmA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPntRCr8Bmg7r5J1uC3gp56bhl4pO34eSiSucNqeu93tg&oe=6ABFB1B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "478899077676648", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_478899084343314_368915632794476489_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OmDGW3MsFiQQ7kNvwGl6dIp&_nc_oc=AdrHJH0kumY7jN9y4G72iuXnQFBpTkZFqEZ9yn9xMBS6HfCauOxKHgbdY7A1pjyr7DQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOFpFk5rHodLSU13LE74z7KdB2kFC3jhkKxA1aBxWePEA&oe=6ABFD8F5"}, "display_name": "VRIT", "keywords": ["fitness", "crossfit", "workout", "body", "fit"], "long_description": "**VRIT** is a VR fitness game made possible by the Quest's hand-tracking feature to let you do true exercises without controllers.  \nDestroy robots and earn rewards while doing your daily workout : **VRIT makes fitness fun.**\n\n# Full body exercises\n{539814865827589}\nDo actual abs, push-ups, burpees and a lot more without having to care about controllers!  \nVRIT can accurately follow your movements using only your head's position.\n\n# Do your daily workout in the ADVENTURE MODE\n{3044080589099219}\nThe robots are trying to steal all your water! Fight them **with your muscles**, alternating between shooting phases and various exercices.  \nThe difficulty of the challenges you face **will adapt to you** over time.  \nGet additional rewards by playing regularly and by being phenomenal!\n\n# CUSTOM PROGRAMS\nCreate your own workout programs and save them for later.\n\n# MUCH, MUCH MORE\nShoot robots using your hands while running in the **RUN** phases!  \nEarn **cosmetics** for your tiny island such as new materials and special props!  \nCompete with your friends in the **leaderboards**!  \nVRIT is more than a simple workout app.  \n\n# It's time for your daily dose of action-packed sport.\n{606607422353949}", "short_description": "Add some action-packed sport to your daily routine with VRIT !"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wasplay.fr/vrit-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wasplay", "support_website_url": "https://wasplay.fr/", "website_url": "https://wasplay.fr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "ACTION", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["